---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import TimeLineElement from "../components/cv/TimeLine.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Resume" sideBarActiveItemID="cv">
  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Profile</div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-10 text-justify space-y-2">
    <p>
      I'm Tien Cheng, an undergraduate reading Computer Science at the
      National University of Singapore (NUS) on the NUS Global Merit
      Scholarship. I'm a graduate of Singapore Polytechnic (SP) with a Diploma
      in Applied AI and Analytics, and a recipient of the Singapore Computer
      Society Silver Medal. As a former co-founder and operations department
      head of SPAI (an AI Singapore Student Chapter) in AY21/22, I actively
      promoted the field of Data Science during my time at SP.
    </p>
    <p>
      I completed my full-time national service as a Software Developer at
      the <a href="https://www.mindef.gov.sg/oms/dis/"
        >Digital and Intelligence Service</a
      >, and I'm currently a Software Engineer Intern at TikTok. Outside of
      work and school, I serve as President of RC4Entre and a Coreteam member
      of NUS Hackers, and I also work on personal projects and competitions in
      my free time.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Education</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container grid gap-4 mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="B.Comp. in Computer Science"
      subtitle="Expected 2029 at National University of Singapore, Singapore"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
        <li>NUS Global Merit Scholarship.</li>
        <li>GPA: 4.79/5.0.</li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Diploma in Applied AI and Analytics"
      subtitle="2020 to 2023 at Singapore Polytechnic, Singapore"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
        <li>GPA: 4/4</li>
        <li>
          Relevant Coursework: Front End Web Development, Back End Web
          Development, AI and Machine Learning, Deep Learning, DevOps for
          Automa‑ tion and AI, Programming for Data Analytics and Statistics for
          Data Science
        </li>
        <li>
          Co-founded SPAI, an AI Singapore Student Chapter, organising three
          successful data science workshops (attended by over 80 students),
          helping SPAI to win an SP Excellence Award in its first year.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Experience</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Software Engineer Intern at TikTok"
      subtitle="From July 2026 to present at TikTok, Singapore"
    />
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Co-Founder at Conform Labs"
      subtitle="From August 2025 to December 2025 at Conform Labs, Singapore"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
        <li>
          Built a voice-agent evaluation framework to compare agent quality
          across simulated conversations using automated scoring and Langfuse
          trace analysis.
        </li>
        <li>
          Developed form analytics, document-to-form generation, and
          real-time voice-agent pipelines with TypeScript, FastAPI, and
          Pipecat.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Software Developer at the Digital and Intelligence Service, Singapore Armed Forces (National Service)"
      subtitle="From May 2023 to August 2025 at Singapore Armed Forces, Singapore"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
        <li>
          Attained the platoon best trainee award in the Signals Institute
          vocational training course.
        </li>
        <li>
          Built an LLM-powered exam-marking platform that reduced instructor
          grading time by over 50% in an air-gapped environment.
        </li>
        <li>
          Improved grader accuracy and robustness by benchmarking prompts and
          automating prompt optimization with DSPy and open-source data.
        </li>
        <li>
          Integrated Langfuse telemetry to monitor traces, latency, and
          scoring quality, reducing time spent debugging the pipeline.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Co-Founder at Flora Softworks"
      subtitle="From February 2023 to October 2023 at Flora Softworks, Singapore"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
        <li>
          Flora is a tech startup that builds software to help organisations
          manage their information, with our primary product being an enterprise
          search application.
        </li>
        <li>
          Built a neural search API for unstructured enterprise documents
          using Elasticsearch, ONNX Runtime, Jina, FastAPI, and MongoDB,
          supporting public-sector and enterprise pilots.
        </li>
        <li>
          Developed unit tests for the AI microservices using Pytest, and also
          set up a Kubeflow pipeline on Vertex AI for running evaluation of our
          neural search engine using BEIR.
        </li>
        <li>
          Improved document-layout detection throughput by 400% by distilling
          and quantizing an RTMDet model for production inference, while also
          improving mean average precision (mAP) from 0.41 to 0.5 (a 21.95%
          improvement).
        </li>
        <li>
          Deployed pilot systems on Google Cloud Platform and refactored
          services for self-hosted environments to enable on-premise adoption
          with clients including SkillsFuture SG, NSCC, and Coherent, Inc.
        </li>
        <li>
          Used OpenTelemetry in combination with Prometheus and Grafana to track
          and monitor the performance of the application, helping to identify
          and resolve memory leaks and bottlenecks.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Intern at Defence Science and Technology Agency"
      subtitle="From September 2022 to February 2023 at Defence Science and Technology Agency, Singapore"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
        <li>
          Core developer of the AI App Store project, an in-house platform built
          using Vue.js and FastAPI for AI developers to publish and share their
          models in the form of model cards, and deploy containers as KNative
          services through a GUI interface.
        </li>
        <li>
          Developed API endpoints to enable the managing of services in a
          Kubernetes cluster through the app, as well as integration with the
          ClearML platform.
        </li>
        <li>
          Developed a custom WYSIWYG editor using the TipTap library, enabling
          the insertion of editable Plotly.js graphs within the markup.
        </li>
        <li>
          Wrote and maintained unit tests, and established automated testing
          through a CI pipeline deployed on GitHub Actions, resulting in a more
          reliable and robust application.
        </li>
        <li>
          Set up Helm charts, documentation and deployed the project on a
          Kubernetes cluster for use internally by two departments within DSTA.
        </li>
        <li>
          Contributed to a separate team project where I developed microservices
          for a prototype real time video analytics pipeline, integrating models
          like YOLOv5 and ByteTrack, using PyTorch, OpenCV, Triton Inference
          Server and Apache Kafka.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Leadership</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="President at RC4Entre"
      subtitle="AY26/27 at RC4Entre, National University of Singapore"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
        <li>
          Leading RC4Entre, the entrepreneurship CCA of Residential College 4
          at NUS.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Coreteam Member at NUS Hackers"
      subtitle="From 2026 at NUS Hackers, Singapore"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
        <li>
          Member of the Coreteam, the organising group behind NUS Hackers'
          events and initiatives for the student hacker community.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Certifications</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
    <li>
      <a
        href="https://www.coursera.org/account/accomplishments/verify/ZRWMSSYD83SW"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        Generative AI with Large Language Models (2023)</a
      >
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Introduction to Machine Learning in Production (2022)</a
      >
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Deep Learning Specialization (2022)</a
      >
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Machine Learning (2021)</a
      >
    </li>
    <li>Wiley Certified Data Analyst (2020)</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Skills</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc md:columns-5 columns-2 mx-6 mb-10">
    <li>Python</li>
    <li>TypeScript</li>
    <li>SQL</li>
    <li>PyTorch</li>
    <li>Hugging Face Transformers</li>
    <li>DSPy</li>
    <li>RAG</li>
    <li>ONNX Runtime</li>
    <li>Scikit-learn</li>
    <li>FastAPI</li>
    <li>Streamlit</li>
    <li>Celery</li>
    <li>PostgreSQL</li>
    <li>PGVector</li>
    <li>MongoDB</li>
    <li>Elasticsearch</li>
    <li>Docker</li>
    <li>Kubernetes</li>
    <li>Google Cloud Platform</li>
    <li>Langfuse</li>
    <li>OpenTelemetry</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Awards</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
    <li>NUS Global Merit Scholarship (2023)</li>
    <li>Singapore Computer Society Silver Medal (2023)</li>
    <li>
      Best Junior Hack of the NTU MLDA Deep Learning Week Hackathon (2021)
    </li>
    <li>
      Champion of the Collegial Artificial Intelligence Innovation Competition
      (2020)
    </li>
    <li>DSTA Polytechnic Digital Scholarship (2020)</li>
    <li>
      1st Place (University Category), HPC Innovation Competition 2023, for
      OwlShield, an LLM safety firewall
    </li>
    <li>
      Contributed a <a
        href="https://github.com/NVIDIA/garak"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">LiteLLM integration</a
      > to NVIDIA's Garak, an open-source LLM security scanner (8k+ stars)
    </li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>
